ActionHandlers registrados (22 handlers):

**Serviços:**
• `searchServices(query, category, limit)` → {count, services, raw}
• `listServices(limit)` → {count, services}
• `listServiceCategories()` → {count, categories}
• `getService(serviceId)` → {service}

**Protocolos:**
• `createProtocol(serviceId, description, customData, documents)` → {protocol}
• `getProtocols(limit)` → {count, protocols}
• `getProtocolByNumber(protocolNumber)` → {protocol}
• `getProtocolDetails(protocolNumber)` → {protocol, protocolDetailCard}
• `addProtocolComment(protocolId, comment)` → {comment}
• `getProtocolInteractions(protocolId)` → {count, interactions}
• `getProtocolDocuments(protocolId)` → {count, documents}

**Perfil e Família:**
• `getCitizenProfile()` → {profile}
• `updateCitizenProfile(name, email, phone, address, birthDate)` → {profile}
• `getFamilyMembers()` → {count, members}

**Notificações:**
• `getNotifications(unreadOnly, limit)` → {count, notifications}
• `markNotificationsAsRead(notificationIds, markAll)` → {marked}

**Documentos:**
• `getDocuments(limit)` → {count, documents}

**Avaliação:**
• `getPendingEvaluations()` → {count, protocols}
• `submitEvaluation(protocolId, rating, comment)` → {evaluation}

**Utilitários:**
• `formatProtocolReview()` → {reviewText, reviewCard}
• `getDepartments()` → {count, departments}
• `getServicesByDepartment(departmentId)` → {count, services, categories, catalogText}
• `processFormSchema(serviceId)` → {hasForm, questions, requiresDocuments, requiredDocuments}

```json
{
  "name": "nome_do_fluxo",
  "description": "Descrição",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": { "icon": "📝", "color": "#hex", "category": "service" },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "message",
      "config": { "text": "Mensagem com {{variavel}}" },
      "transitions": [{ "to": "proximo_nodo" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "menu_opcoes",
      "type": "menu",
      "config": {
        "text": "Escolha:",
        "options": [{"id": "op1", "label": "Opção 1", "description": "..."}],
        "saveAs": "escolha"
      },
      "transitions": [
        { "when": "op1", "to": "nodo_op1" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "verificar",
      "type": "condition",
      "config": {
        "conditions": [{
          "field": "dados.count",
          "operator": "gt",
          "value": 0,
          "goto": "nodo_sucesso"
        }],
        "defaultGoto": "nodo_vazio"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "end",
      "config": { "returnToMain": true }
    }
  ]
}
```

